        <mxCell id="note_0" value="ApprovalsPage includes RefundDecision in StaffPages.tsx.&lt;br&gt;Controller operations fold service, payment, user and audit&lt;br&gt;responsibilities.&lt;br&gt;The pending query populates bookingId and requestedBy, then sorts by&lt;br&gt;createdAt.&lt;br&gt;Current payOS proxy performs no external refund call." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="677.35" y="674.0258" width="496" height="98" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
